# ADU bytes: the 7 byte MBAP header (transaction id, protocol id, length, unit id), then the PDU.
# Modbus Messaging on TCP/IP Implementation Guide V1.0b (the MBAP header description; section number not checked, the PDF is not retained), wrapped around the Modbus Application Protocol V1.1b section 6.4, Read Input Registers, request example.
